DINOv3 ConvNeXt-L backbone + same transformer head as dino/train_dino_transformer.py
- starts from LVD-1689M weights (no classifier stage), trained end-to-end on video bags, Paxos2025 only (mil_*_2025.json)
- adapter (transformer/adapters.py, shared with the DINO dense path) maps the feature map to token(s) per frame:
  linear_attnpool (1x1 conv + LN + 2D sin/cos PE + query attention pooling, default), linear_mean, grid;
  --adapter_tokens K, --grid_pool max, --no_adapter_pe
- --feature_stage/--feature_block take an earlier map (stage 3: 768x32x32), later blocks skipped
- no temporal encoding, no entropy loss, final LayerNorm after the blocks
- defaults: lr 1e-5, backbone x0.1, 1 block / 8 heads, cdw 0.2, cosine to 1e-7 (epochs default 12, baseline uses 25)
- gradient accumulation and --freeze_epochs were tried and removed

Baseline (2026-10-21): stage 3 last block, linear_attnpool, unfrozen x0.1, 25 ep, random-segment, --complex_augs,
--selection_metric combined. 5 splits: QWK 0.883/0.867/0.821/0.877/0.795, mean 0.849 +- 0.039, acc 0.645, F1 0.564,
RR 0.846 +- 0.045 (DINO frozen bv2: 0.840 +- 0.051, RR 0.877). Late epochs unstable.

History
2026-10-13 collapse: first runs predicted one grade for all videos. Generic features are very similar across videos
(cos sim ~0.94) but a standardized GAP probe reaches QWK ~0.78. Head lr >= 1e-4 collapses; 5e-5/3e-5 stable.
Unfreezing at x0.3 broke the features within ~50 steps (all videos -> same adapter vector), not caused by std/gamma/fp16.
Frozen + standardized, lr 5e-5: best QWK 0.758.
2026-10-14 linear_mean, unfrozen x0.1 (first non-collapsing unfrozen runs), split 1: std on lr 5e-5 0.864; std off
lr 5e-5 0.830 (collapsed ep 0-4, recovered); std off lr 1e-5 cosine 18 ep 0.848, smooth. --cluster_sample: 0.856 but
overfits late, no gain over random sampling (unlike the ViT on old clips).
2026-10-15 linear_attnpool (x0.1, no std, lr 1e-5, cosine 18 ep): best 0.855 (RR 0.758), overfits less than linear_mean
(new clips 0.866). x0.3/x1.0 break it.
2026-10-15 earlier layers (linear_mean, 18 ep): stage 3 last block 0.833, block 13 0.795, stage 2 never learns.
2026-10-16 25 ep: stage 3 linear_mean 0.858, stage 3 linear_attnpool 0.871 (RR 0.848), stage 2 still fails.
--bag_consistent_augs: 0.876 vs 0.871, no consistent effect.
2026-10-20: feature standardization removed (old checkpoints load with feat_mean/feat_std dropped, *_std_* runs change outputs).
2026-10-21: Paxos2020 mixing (split 1): QWK 0.880, RR 0.909 vs 0.888/0.879, no gain.
2026-10-22: dense tokens (split 1, baseline HPs, K=4): linear_attnpool4 0.865/RR 0.848, grid4 0.828/RR 0.848 vs baseline
0.883/0.909; grid4 overfits. Keep 1 token (unlike DINO).
